  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_1926.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este martes, D&iacute;a del Salvador, se ha inaugurado en la calle Vila-real de Onda El Quiosco del T&iacute;o Cris, que cuenta tambi&eacute;n con una peque&ntilde;a cafeter&iacute;a, con la presencia de familiares y amistades de Cristian Garc&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1917.jpg\" alt=\"img_1917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1918.jpg\" alt=\"img_1918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1919.jpg\" alt=\"img_1919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1920.jpg\" alt=\"img_1920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1921.jpg\" alt=\"img_1921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1922.jpg\" alt=\"img_1922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1923.jpg\" alt=\"img_1923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1924.jpg\" alt=\"img_1924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/img_1925.jpg\" alt=\"img_1925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugquioscotiocris/im